      "draft_text": "SYNTHETIC data. MOCK action. LLM live.\n\nSubject: Dispute of early-pay discount deduction AM-DISC on JP-INV-2718\n\nHello Alder Market Cooperative deductions team,\n\nThe early-pay discount deduction AM-DISC is not supported. The signed supply terms allow the 2% early-pay discount only when payment is received within 10 days of the invoice date. The invoice is dated 2026-09-18 and the bank posting is dated 2026-10-18, which is outside that window. The full AM-DISC amount remains disputed.\n\nPlease send any amended commercial terms or other signed records that would support the discount.\n\nSupporting records: Signed supply terms (early_pay_days 10; early_pay_bp 200); JP-INV-2718 issued September 18; Bank posting October 18; Juniper collection authority (tolerance zero).",
